        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Tiny Harvest</strong>, a small and relaxing desktop game that lives quietly on your screen while you work, study, or browse the internet.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HOW DOES IT WORK?</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the corner of your desktop, a tiny space farmer responds to every click and keystroke you make throughout the day. You don’t need to pay attention, he takes care of planting and harvesting on his own. As you harvest space plants, you'll earns credits you can then use, along with your  inputs, to upgrade his tools, crops, home, and spaceship. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PERSONALIZATION</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to personalize your farmer? Unlock a variety of charming hats as you go and choose between two different characters. They won’t boost performance, but they’ll definitely boost style.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LIGHTWIGHT AND COZY</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tiny Harvest is an idle game with no intrusive menus, no pop-ups, and no stress. Lightweight, cozy, always present—like a virtual houseplant that thrives quietly while you go about your day.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Tiny Harvest</strong>, a small and relaxing desktop game that lives quietly on your screen while you work, study, or browse the internet.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HOW DOES IT WORK?</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the corner of your desktop, a tiny space farmer responds to every click and keystroke you make throughout the day. You don’t need to pay attention, he takes care of planting and harvesting on his own. As you harvest space plants, you'll earns credits you can then use, along with your  inputs, to upgrade his tools, crops, home, and spaceship. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PERSONALIZATION</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to personalize your farmer? Unlock a variety of charming hats as you go and choose between two different characters. They won’t boost performance, but they’ll definitely boost style.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LIGHTWIGHT AND COZY</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tiny Harvest is an idle game with no intrusive menus, no pop-ups, and no stress. Lightweight, cozy, always present—like a virtual houseplant that thrives quietly while you go about your day.</p>",
        "short_description": "Tiny Harvest is a relaxing desktop game that runs while you work, study, or browse the internet. Grow space plants, upgrade your crops, ship, home, and tools, and enjoy a cozy, minimalist experience designed to keep you company throughout your day.",
